OL,3,GNEWSAMake sure use of AI is safe, data
OL,4,Awatchdog warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's data protection authority
OL,7,Fhas warned the responsibility for
OL,8,Fprotecting client data "can't be
OL,9,Foutsourced" amid concerns over the
OL,10,Fspeed of artificial intelligence
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
OL,13,FDemands for laws and rules to control
OL,14,FAI have grown after experts in the
OL,15,Fsector called for a slow down and last
OL,16,Fmonth it was revealed a "rogue" OpenAI
OL,17,Fagent hacked Australia's online medical
OL,18,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
