OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMake sure use of AI is safe, data
OL,4,Awatchdog warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrent Homan, commissioner for the
OL,7,FOffice of the Data Protection
OL,8,FAuthority, said Guernsey businesses
OL,9,Fneeded to reflect on their use of AI
OL,10,Fseriously.
OL,12,F"Ultimately any organisation can
OL,13,Foutsource certain responsibilities, but
OL,14,Fthey can't outsource their
OL,15,Faccountability," he said.
